! Showcase — the terminal side of the rice.
!
! Pseudo-transparent, no compositor: urxvt reads the root pixmap tauler
! published after blitting its <wallpaper> (_XROOTPMAP_ID) and paints its own
! crop of it, shaded to 45 so the fetch and the tree stay legible. The font
! list is a fallback chain: the first face that has a glyph draws it, so the
! swatches' block characters and the tree's box drawing come from the symbol
! font when JetBrains Mono lacks them. Pixel sizes, so they are stated for
! the 4K screen the scenario runs on (tauler-e2e/tests/scenarios.rs): twice
! what they would be at 1080p.

URxvt.font:           xft:JetBrains Mono:pixelsize=30,xft:Symbols Nerd Font Mono:pixelsize=30
URxvt.foreground:     #e0def4
URxvt.background:     #232136
URxvt.internalBorder: 32
URxvt.scrollBar:      false
URxvt.transparent:    true
URxvt.shading:        45
